            "notes": "If you have 13000, pick Lumerico + 25 armor/shield. \n\nYou may also be asking yourself: why so much health? Personally, the way that I think Lucio supports his team best, is by acting as kind of an off-tank where it's needed. You're not going to save people by healing them as Lucio, generally. You're going to save people by booping and bullying whoever is threatening them, and that requires being tanky. \n\nAlso, I'm not the most mindful player, I run into damage often, and if I died every time I made a mistake, I'd probably still be bronze (or whatever the equivalent is in this mode).",
